WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.220
Plan a speech around a purpose and audience; gather facts, arrange arguments, use

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.923
examples and clear signposts, and speak confidently.

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:13.114
Which audience suits a school notice? Answer: Learners and school staff.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.334
Deliver a two-minute speech on water safety with an introduction, three points,

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:19.795
evidence and a conclusion.

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:24.243
Why it works: Notices give information to the school community.
